<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-11-18T22:14:09.140Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 22:14:09 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthis have taken control of the Bab al-Mandeb strait and nearby positions after Yemeni government forces withdrew, moving within about 60 km of Aden. Saudi Arabia dismissed its coalition commander as anti-Houthi forces pulled back from the strait and other key areas, while Saudi-backed forces have intensified attacks on Houthi positions, hitting dozens of military sites. The Yemeni parliament passed a law designating the Houthis as terrorists, raising concerns about a resurgence by southern separatists. Reuters reports Saudi Arabia is preparing a Yemen campaign that could last into 2027. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168830&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxQQzNxM2VmcTZFMzVBdFJBOWs2bGVWa3dfNEZUVnFzUm5RTDVmMG1JRk5SbU1YWTRTUFAxdGpJOEw5Ti1DWnFFYzViNnVoS1V6RXJhbmh3a3hqZURsM3NKN0ZIdHZzekVzSHJ5dmhqOUpLeTIyTjA4ZGRRR2MzQmd3dkdvcDJoV0Rja2M3UnVYZmdkLUZ3S2s4eTRvMzlPeVJ4ZU5kaUdPTnJLcDhT?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxNa0txUndxQmRJNU1nMUZSVFc5d29OSDkwSWMyOHB5VC1iVVZwY3IwaEs3VlRkbEtHVGRmazVueE1YSjA4N0N4OElZRVdfM0trQ0dnaVptanRtRWVoWERLMWlUUjlac2ozVlRjMWdqMDQ1ODBOZEtPb2FKVFA0UXJpeGdjck1OMDMzdEhhQ2piTDd4QnFXcm12Vlh2MHVKcXNQUTdJWVZlV1E?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxOemlDVjJFbDBFNWYzWTBwekZJZ21ZQUc0MkFjODhPSlNXMHFrQldGMXhXek56OF9DRlVfckZDaVIxV2FZY3FzdGh1czNsRHJkdjlGcXZJdEFFb1V5SURWRmVnazZ1anhEUEI2aGMyLU5IMFEyU0l1M1lGanNzZ2c2aVR2TzBwYjg0TVFMbU51aHJKNWlWTXFRZWJHS2ZEY0F